    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a technical recruiter. Evaluate how well this GitHub developer matches the job brief.\n\nGitHub does not state skills, experience or English level directly. Infer them:\n- skills: from repository languages and descriptions\n- estimated_years: from account age and repo history (account age is a weak signal, say so in reasoning if it drives the estimate). Today is {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}, count years from this date.\n- english_level: from the bio and repo descriptions (\"Unknown\" if there is nothing to judge)\n- position_title: short title that fits the profile, e.g. \"Python Developer\"\n\nScore 0-100 with this rubric:\n- must-have skills: up to 60 points\n- nice-to-have skills: up to 25 points\n- location and English: up to 15 points\n\nJOB BRIEF\nRole: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.role_title }}\nContext: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.company_context }}\nLocation: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.location }}\nExperience: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.experience_years }} years\nMust have: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.must_have_skills.join(', ') }}\nNice to have: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.nice_to_have_skills.join(', ') }}\nEnglish: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.english_level_min }}+\nSummary: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.brief_summary }}\n\nCANDIDATE\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nBio: {{ $json.bio }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nGitHub account created: {{ $json.account_created }}\nPublic repos: {{ $json.public_repos }}, followers: {{ $json.followers }}\nTop repositories:\n{{ $json.top_repos }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
