    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a personalized outreach email to a developer about a job opportunity.\nWarm but professional, 4-5 sentences. Write in English.\n\nStructure:\n1. Greeting + ONE specific detail from their profile that shows you actually read it (a top repo or a skill combo)\n2. Brief role pitch (1-2 sentences)\n3. Why they specifically caught your eye\n4. Soft CTA: open to a 15-min chat?\n\nSubject: max 60 characters.\n\nSign the email as:\n{{ $('Job Brief').first().json.sender_name }}\n{{ $('Job Brief').first().json.sender_title }}\nNever use placeholders like [Your Name] or [Company].\n\nROLE\n{{ $('Job Brief').first().json.role_title }}, {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.location }}\n{{ $('Job Brief').first().json.brief_summary }}\nSalary: {{ $('Job Brief').first().json.salary_range_usd }} USD/month\n\nCANDIDATE\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nBio: {{ $json.bio }}\nSkills: {{ $json.skills }}\nWhy they scored {{ $json.score }}/100: {{ $json.reasoning }}\nTop repositories:\n{{ $json.top_repos }}",
